    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 02, 2022\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 07.09.2022)\n\nSRI LANKA NATIONAL COMMISSION FOR UNESCO\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Education\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 45.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nto provide for the establishment of the Sri Lanka National Commissionfor the United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization(UNESCO); and for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nA\n\n1Sri Lanka National Commission for UNESCO\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nShort title\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O 46/2008\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF THE SRI LANKANATIONAL COMMISSION FOR THE UNITED NATIONS EDUCATIONAL,SCIENTIFIC AND CULTURAL ORGANIZATION (UNESCO); AND FOR\n\nMATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO\n\nBe it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka NationalCommission for UNESCO Act, No. \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026 of 2022.\n\nPART I\n\nESTABLISHMENT OF THE SRI LANKA NATIONAL COMMISSION FORUNESCO\n\n2.(1) There shall be established a Commission whichshall be called the Sri Lanka National Commission forUNESCO (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCommission\u201d).\n\n(2) The Commission shall, by the name assigned to it bysubsection (1), be a body corporate with perpetual successionand a common seal and may sue and be sued in such name.\n\n3.The objects of the Commission shall be:-\n\n(a) to provide the required forum for internationaland intellectual co-operation, through thefacilitation of a globally connected networkingsystem pertaining to field of competencies ofUNESCO ;"
