    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. (Dr.) Harsha de Silva, M.P.for Colombo District on 31st of August, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 22, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 148]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nSRI LANKA BAPTIST SANGAMAYA(INCORPORATION) (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamaya (Incorporation)Act, No. 54 of 1944\n\n1Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamaya (Incorporation)(Amendment)\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA BAPTIST SANGAMAYA(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 54 OF 1944\n\nWHEREAS the members of the Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamayaformally known as Ceylon Baptist Council incorporatedunder Ceylon Baptist Council Ordinance No. 54 of 1944 asamended by the Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamaya (Incorporation)(Amendment) Act, No. 14 of 1991 have passed a resolutionto amend the name of the Sangamaya:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Sangamaya, for the purpose ofgiving effect to such resolution has applied to change thename of such Sangamaya and it will be expedient to grantsuch application:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, be it enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2.In every context in which the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya is mentioned (whether by that name or by theabbreviation of \u201cthe Sangamaya\u201d) in the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya Act, No. 14 of 1991 (Incorporation) (Amendment)or in any notice or other document issued under that Act,there shall, unless the context otherwise requires, besubstituted for the expressions \u201cthe Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya\u201d or \u201cthe Sangamaya\u201d, the expressions \u201cSri LankaBaptist Church or \u201cthe Church\u201d, as the case may be."
