    "chunk_text": "1. (1) This Act may be cited as the Civil Procedure Code(Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n(2) The provisions of this Act shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order publishedin the Gazette.\n\n3. Chapter LXVI (sections 801 to 833B both inclusive)of the principal enactment is hereby repealed.\n\n4. The First Schedule to the principal enactment ishereby amended by the repeal of Form No. 136 thereof.\n\n5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nGeneralamendmentof Chapter101\n\nRepeal ofChapterLXVI of theprincipalenactment\n\nAmendmentof FirstSchedule tothe principalenactment\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency\n\n2Civil Procedure Code (Amendment)\n\nDEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING"
