    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Premnath C. Dolawatte, M.P.for Colombo District on 12th of August, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 11, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 18.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 134]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nSIYANE KATIKAWA NALAKA GODAHEWAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Siyane Katikawa Nalaka Godahewa Foundation\n\nSiyane Katikawa Nalaka Godahewa Foundation(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SIYANE KATIKAWA NALAKAGODAHEWA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Society called and known as the \u201cSiyaneKatikawa Nalaka Godahewa Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectually carryingout its objects and transacting all matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expendient to grant saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Siyane Katikawa NalakaGodahewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2022."
