    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Hon. Kumara Welgama, M.P.for Kalutara District on 12th of August, 2022\n\n(Published in the Gazette on July 25, 2022)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPrice : Rs. 24.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nThis Bill can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n[Bill No. 133]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nBILL\n\nA\n\nRAIGAMPURA COMMUNITYDEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Raigampura Community Development Foundation\n\n1Raigampura Community Development Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE RAIGAMPURA COMMUNITYDEVELOPMENT FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cRaigampura Community Development Foundation\u201d hasheretofore been formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out its objects and transacting all mattersconnected with the said Trust according to the rules agreed toby its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Raigampura CommunityDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2022."
