    "chunk_size_bytes": 1800,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Siyane Katikawa NalakaGodahewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\nShort title\n\nPreamble\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof the SiyaneKatikawaNalakaGodahewaFoundation\n\n30\n\n2Siyane Katikawa Nalaka Godahewa Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be \u2014\n\n(a) to contribute towards the creation of family units thathave fulfilled their basic needs, live in a secureenviroment and appreciate culture, literature, Arts andsports;\n\n(b) to contribute towards the creation of a socialenviroment where a citizen\u2019s human rights and dignityare protected and justice is served; and\n\n(c) to contribute towards the creation of a society thatdisciplined and law abiding where citizens respectand help each other.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insub-section (1) the body corporate shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n4.The objects of the body corporate shall be carried outin such manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Body corporate and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council."
