    "chunk_text": "Continuationin office ofthe membersof theCouncil\n\nPowers andduties of theCouncil\n\nTwenty Second Amendment to the Constitution12\n\n41H. The expenses incurred by the Councilshall be charged on the Consolidated Fund.\n\n4.Paragraph (1) of Article 44 is of the Constitutionhereby amended by deletion of the words, \u201cin consultationwith the Prime Minister where he considers such consultationto necessary\u201d and substitution of the words \u201con advice ofthe Prime Minister\u201d.\n\n5.Paragraph (1) of Article 45 is of the Constitutionhereby amended by deletion of the words, \u201cin consultationwith the Prime Minister where he considers such consultationto necessary\u201d and substitution of the words \u201con advice ofthe Prime Minister\u201d.\n\n6.Paragraph (2) of Article 45 of the Constitution ishereby amended by addition of the words \u201con advice of thePrime Minister\u201d before the words \u201cthe President.\u201d\n\n7.Paragraph (1) of Article 46 of the Constitution ishereby amended by deletion of the words \u201cin consultationwith the Prime Minister where he considers such consultationto necessary\u201d and substitution of the words \u201con advice ofthe Prime Minister.\u201d\n\n8.Paragraphs (3) and (4) of Article 47 of the Constitutionis hereby repealed.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nExpenses tobe chargedon theConsolidatedFund\n\nFinality ofdecisions ofthe Council\n\namendmentof Article 44of theConstitution\n\namendmentof Article 45of theConstitution\n\namendmentof Article 45of theConstitution\n\namendmentof Article 46of theConstitution\n\namendmentof Article 47of theConstitution\n\n13Twenty Second Amendment to the Constitution\n\n9.Article 54 of the Constitution is hereby amended asfollows:\u2013\n\nPUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION\n\n(1) by the repeal of paragraph (1) of thatArticle, and the substitution therefor ofthe following paragraph:\u2013"
