    "chunk_size_bytes": 2005,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kidney and DiabetesLions Hospital Trust (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organization(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\nShort title\n\n10\n\nPreamble\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nIncorporationof the Kidneyand DiabetesLionsHospitalTrust\n\n30\n\nKidney and Diabetes LionsHospital Trust (Incorporation)2\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the body corporateis constituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to provide facilities to the community for a healthylife style;\n\n(b) to establish a Hospital for kidney and Diabeticpatients;\n\n(c) to identify, educate, treat kidney and diabetic patientsespecially for families with low income and minimumfacilities;\n\n(d) to conduct lectures, seminars, workshops and any othersuch activities in order to invigilate the public of thekidney and diabetic as well as any other noncommunicable diseases;\n\n(e) to establish companionship with the establishments,organizations or any other organizational entitieswithin and outside Sri Lanka;\n\n(f) to print, publish and distribute books, magazines andleaflets that the corporation think suit to achieve andpromote the objectives of the corporation; and\n\n(g) to establish and maintain an elders\u2019 homeamalgamated to the kidney hospital;\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste, sex,political opinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nGeneralobjects of theBodycorporate\n\n3Kidney and Diabetes LionsHospital Trust (Incorporation)"
