    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of February 11, 2022\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.02.2022)\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nThis Gazette Supplement can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 442 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the amendmentis to make provision to issue one certified copy of the judgment or final order of the record toeach of the parties to the case free of charge.\n\nClause 3: This clause amends section 443 of the principal enactment and is consequential tothe amendment made by clause 2.\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title\n\nReplacementof section442 of Act,No. 15 of1979\n\n25\n\nL. D.\u2013O. 45/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows: -\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.\n\n2. Section 442 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby repealed and the following section issubstituted therefor: -"
